  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RiddleInteractable
  interactDinstance: 2
  promptFadeBuffer: 0.2
  riddleNumber: 0
  speakerName: You
  dialogueLines:
  - There seems to be a note left on my monitor.
  - 'It reads: "I stand and wait, both clear and cold,"'
  - '"A place where secrets are often told."'
  - '"Thirsty minds come gather near,"'
  - '"your next clue quietly rests here."'
  - 'Seriously? Is this gonna be a scavenger hunt? '
  - Y'know what, why not. I have nothing better to do after work anyways.
  - The next clue seems to be near the water jug.
  - I wonder who set this up...
